Package: mfdesign
Title: Matcha + Finn Figure Design System
Version: 1.4.0
Authors@R: person("Brandon", "Lukas", email = "brandonlukas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The shared figure design system of the Matcha/Finn repos (matcha2, finn2,
    matchafinn-apps): colour tokens, type and stroke scales, the journal ggplot2 theme, and the
    panel export helpers. The single source of truth is inst/tokens.json; STYLE.md holds the rules.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ggplot2, jsonlite, grid, legendry
Suggests: svglite, ggrastr, viridisLite, scales
Collate: tokens.R palette.R theme.R export.R heatmap.R tracks.R
